# Flamewake Phoenix dies to Bot2's Lightning Bolt in turn 2. In turn 3 Bot1 casts no creature with power 4 or greater (Alpine Grizzly stays in hand), so the Ferocious intervening "if" (CR 603.4) is false at the beginning of combat: nothing triggers, nothing is asked, and the Phoenix stays in the graveyard.

